    "proseDraft": "It was confirmed that Imani sends the customer email from the helpdesk by Wednesday 2026-11-04 at 12:00 PT and Felix shares the workspace export with her by 09:00 PT, with the recheck passing. Other remarks about credits, customer emails, email contents, tickets, the post-mortem, the status page delay and adding a step were stated but were not recorded as confirmed, and nothing else was recorded as confirmed.\n\nConfirmed by participants\n- It was confirmed by Imani, Felix and Sunil that Imani sends the customer email from the helpdesk by Wednesday 2026-11-04 at 12:00 PT and Felix shares the workspace export with her by 09:00 PT with the recheck passing.\n\nStated in the meeting\n- Someone said they will have the credits applied by Thursday.\n- Someone said the customer emails will be handled by tomorrow.\n- Someone mentioned plain language, the credit, and what was changed.\n- Someone asked Imani to close out the open tickets once the email is out.\n- Someone said they will do that with a macro.\n- Someone said they will publish the post-mortem on the blog after legal reads it.\n- Someone said the status page went up 20 minutes late.\n- Someone said they will add a step for it."
